   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "block": "smartphones.dlg27",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's polite and often required. Check the course rules or just ask the lecturer after class. Most say yes for personal study.",
